nalty for the whole party  another important part of your gear up  belts as they hold many useful items a  character can carry into battle good  belts can hold up to four items third  slots are for healing and astral potions  throwing weapons poisons and traps  without a belt you can't use them in  combat  did you win an especially tricky battle  by lateral thinking or did you use other  even dirty tricks to make your party's  life easier well tell us right here or  in the forums or visit us on Facebook  our forums and of course the official  Black Arts homepage there you can find  the most recent news regarding black  arts and day Dalek if you want to read  the content of this video again there's  also a text guide you still didn't join  the adventure then off you go and  download your digital version at steam  or car comm we hope you're now ready to  take on any battle in event area  you
 

